exports[`+ 메뉴 (T-034) > 34.1 + 클릭 → 메뉴 3개: 프로젝트 폴더 열기…, 최근 프로젝트, 파일 첨부 (스냅샷) 1`] = `"<div class="hx-composer"><textarea class="hx-composer__input" aria-label="지시 입력" rows="2" placeholder="지시를 입력하세요 (Enter 전송 · Shift+Enter 줄바꿈)"></textarea><div class="hx-popover hx-plus-menu" role="menu" aria-label="추가 메뉴"><button data-action="plus.open-folder" type="button" role="menuitem" class="hx-popover__item"><span class="hx-popover__check" aria-hidden="true">📁</span><span class="hx-popover__label">프로젝트 폴더 열기…</span></button><button data-action="plus.recent" type="button" role="menuitem" class="hx-popover__item" aria-haspopup="true" aria-expanded="false"><span class="hx-popover__check" aria-hidden="true">🕘</span><span class="hx-popover__label">최근 프로젝트</span></button><button data-action="plus.attach" type="button" role="menuitem" class="hx-popover__item"><span class="hx-popover__check" aria-hidden="true">📎</span><span class="hx-popover__label">파일 첨부</span></button></div><input multiple="" hidden="" data-testid="attach-input" type="file"><div class="hx-composer__bar" role="toolbar" aria-label="입력 도구"><button data-action="composer.plus" type="button" class="hx-plus" aria-label="추가" data-slot="plus" aria-haspopup="menu" aria-expanded="true">+</button><div class="hx-chip-wrap hx-chip--permission"><button data-action="composer.chip" type="button" class="hx-chip" aria-label="권한: 워크스페이스 쓰기" aria-haspopup="menu" aria-expanded="false"><span aria-hidden="true">◎</span><span>워크스페이스 쓰기</span><span class="hx-chip__caret" aria-hidden="true">▾</span></button></div><div class="hx-chip-wrap hx-chip--mode"><button data-action="composer.chip" type="button" class="hx-chip" aria-label="모드: 일반" aria-haspopup="menu" aria-expanded="false"><span>일반</span><span class="hx-chip__caret" aria-hidden="true">▾</span></button></div><span class="hx-composer__spacer"></span><button data-action="composer.send" type="button" class="hx-send" aria-label="전송" disabled="" title="보낼 내용을 먼저 적어 주세요">↑</button></div><div class="hx-verdict" aria-live="polite" data-testid="verdict"><span class="hx-verdict__empty">판정 대기</span></div></div>"`;
